<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/form-canon> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#mutationPlan> "the theme chases its own delayed and rotated copies; they are made of its bars, so `~ theme_* rot 2` and `rev` move the leader and its followers together"@en .
