<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/form-quodlibet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The quodlibet, a form from classical music: canon ode fate voices canon voices: one theme leads each section, the others under it. `~ a_* morph b_1 p` paired later with `~ b_* morph a_1 p`, the pair pulled away by a morph toward a third line, `@` one-shot borrowings; `~` persists and compounds pass on pass (loop 3)."@en .
