<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/form-rondo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The rondo, a form from classical music: refrain episode refrain sung refrain episode refrain sung refrain: A B A C A B A C A. The refrain mutated on each return: `~ rot 2 | accent`, `@ mirror | vel 2` for one return, `~ up 1` then `~ down 1`; the episode morphs toward the refrain."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/form-rondo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "rondo"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/form-rondo> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#formShape> "refrain episode refrain sung refrain episode refrain sung refrain: A B A C A B A C A"@en .
