<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/form-theme-and-variations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The theme and variations, a form from classical music: theme variation variation variation sung variation theme. One source, a different transform for each section as a one-shot `@` (`rev`, `invert`, `stutter 2`, `oct -1`, `half | accent`), so the theme comes back unchanged; no cross-morphs."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/form-theme-and-variations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "theme and variations"@en .
