<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/free-smc> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The category whose objects are multisets of places and whose morphisms are generated by the net's transitions. A deck's net is read as this category: what the deck can do is exactly what the category's morphisms can do."@en .
