<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-atom> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The atom production of BeatScript's grammar (a hit; a rest; c3 f#2 bb4; a scale degree of the key: 1 3 5; a degree computed: ($i + 1); deg(1 b3 5' ~); i VI V7/7: a chord of the key; /3 /5 /7 an inversion; a def's parameter: $chords; a group: squeezed into one slot; commas stack; alternation: one term per cycle; choose [a b c] weights 3 1 1; a let pattern's name)."@en .
