<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-escape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The escape production of BeatScript's grammar (PHONES (beatscript-v1): aa ae uh aw eh er ii ee uu oo ay ie oy ow oh p b t d k g f v s z sh zh th dh h m n ng l r w y ch j, \"_\" a rest, \"-\" cuts a word, \":\" holds a vowel one more note, \"!\" accents it)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-escape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "escape"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-escape> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf> "\"/\" PHONES \"/\"" .
