<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-gen> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The gen production of BeatScript's grammar (gen@2 techno seed=42 section=drop part=bass: the seeded generator, called; GEN is gen@2 or a bare gen)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-gen> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "gen"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-gen> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf> "GEN NAME \"seed\" \"=\" ( INT | NAME ) { gen_param }" .
