<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-headed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-headed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The headed production of BeatScript's grammar (a deck's parts: no time word before them; the control deck; a def's call, a duck and a mix name their decks themselves)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-headed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "headed"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-headed> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ebnf> "\"deck\" deck \":\" parts [ guard ] | [ timing \":\" ] [ target \":\" ] control [ cguard ] | [ timing \":\" ] \"control\" \":\" ( engine | do | duck | mix ) [ cguard ] | [ timing \":\" ] ( invoke | duck | mix ) [ cguard ]" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-headed> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#grammarSection> "Lines: when, where, what"@en .
