<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-lyric-text> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The lyric_text production of BeatScript's grammar (\"/\" and a space is a phrase break; \"/\" and a phoneme opens an escape, to the next \"/\" (with none, a break too); a word touching \"=\" before an escape is its label, kept and not sung: jingle=/j ii ng g uh l/)."@en .
