<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-quodlibet> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#PhraseTemplate> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-quodlibet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-template> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-quodlibet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The phrase template quodlibet: a quodlibet at 96 in D: public-domain themes take turns by section and cross-morph toward each other and away in cycles; the phrase sung over the ground. Written arrange from template(quodlibet, @psalm42_deep_calleth)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-quodlibet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "quodlibet"@en .
