<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-rondo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#PhraseTemplate> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-rondo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/grammar-template> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-rondo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The phrase template rondo: a rondo at 116 in C: Joplin's Entertainer as the refrain, returning mutated between episodes (Bach's Prelude in C, the phrase sung). Written arrange from template(rondo, @shanty_drunken_sailor)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-rondo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "rondo"@en .
