<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-theme-and-variations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The phrase template theme-and-variations: a theme and variations at 84 in D-flat: Dvorak's New World Largo, a different transform in each section and no cross-morphs; the phrase sung in one. Written arrange from template(theme-and-variations, @dickinson_chariot_death)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/template-theme-and-variations> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "theme-and-variations"@en .
