<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/theme-role-melody> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ThemeRole> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/theme-role-melody> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A theme written for the melody part: a tune: the line a person hums."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/theme-role-melody> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "melody"@en .
