<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-beatscript-devices> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "List the phones paired with the token's account (djrust on Android scans the QR code that https://beatscript.app shows under Mobile; site/PAIRING.md): id, name, fingerprint (the code both ends showed at pairing), paired, connected (djrust has its stream open now), last_seen, and state (what it last reported: cid, playing, section, bar). Pairing is the grant: a phone paired by an account is driven over MCP with that account's token and no other.\n\nPass a phone's id as device to eval, load, get or stop to drive that phone alone (eval and load run the same checks as for a tab; a program with errors, samples or \"use restricted\" is not sent). Needs a bearer token. Read-only."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-beatscript-devices> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "devices"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-beatscript-devices> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#inputSchema> "{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{},\"required\":[],\"type\":\"object\"}" .
