<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-classes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "All classes in the ontology namespace with their direct superclasses, as asserted: a superclass another listed one already implies is left out, so LiveNet lists DeadlockFreeNet, not PetriNet too. For the inferred closure, query rdfs:subClassOf with sparql_query."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-classes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "list_classes"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-classes> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#inputSchema> "{\"properties\":{},\"type\":\"object\"}" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-classes> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#needsToken> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
