<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-genres> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Every genre the engine knows, with its tempo, scale, family and groove. Filter by family (edm, song, jazz, chill) or by a BPM range."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-genres> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "list_genres"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-genres> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#inputSchema> "{\"properties\":{\"family\":{\"description\":\"edm, song, jazz or chill; omit for all\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"max_bpm\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"min_bpm\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-genres> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#needsToken> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-list-genres> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#providedBy> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/product-beatscript-ontology-mcp> .
