<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-search-terms> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#McpTool> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-search-terms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Find terms whose label, other label (an alternative or a former name, such as btw for BeatScript) or definition contains the text (case-insensitive). A class with no definition of its own gets the one of the glossary concept it closeMatches, or its rdfs:comment."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-search-terms> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "search_terms"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-search-terms> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#inputSchema> "{\"properties\":{\"limit\":{\"description\":\"max results, default 25, at most 200\",\"type\":\"integer\"},\"text\":{\"description\":\"text to look for\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"text\"],\"type\":\"object\"}" .
