<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-sparql-query> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#McpTool> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/tool-ontology-sparql-query> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Run a read-only SPARQL query (SELECT, ASK, CONSTRUCT or DESCRIBE) over the BeatScript ontology. Rows are capped and queries time out. Results can contain blank nodes (OWL class expressions); add FILTER(isIRI(?x)) to skip them."@en .
