<https://beatscript.app/ontology/genre/acid> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "acid: a genre the seeded generator (generate, gen@N) knows (djrust's own genre, beyond beats' catalogue, following techno's musicality rules), as its tables give it: 125 BPM, minor from MIDI note 45, the four on floor groove, kick E(4,16), snare E(2,16) rotated 4, hihat E(4,16) rotated 2, swing 10, chords 1-1-7-1 or 1-4-1-4."@en .
