<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/breakbeat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The bass plays about three eighths of the steps, evenly spread and randomly rotated, independent of the kick."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/breakbeat> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/groove/breakbeat> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/four-on-floor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Groove> .
