<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/four-on-floor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The bass plays exactly where the kick plays."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/four-on-floor> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/groove/four-on-floor> .
