<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/sidechained> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The bass plays wherever the kick does not, so the two never sound together."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/sidechained> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/groove/sidechained> .
