<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/syncopated-pocket> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The bass follows the kick and adds two off-beat hits, on steps 6 and 14 of a sixteen-step bar (3 and 7 of eight)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/groove/syncopated-pocket> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/groove/syncopated-pocket> .
