<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#AuthorSignature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A signature by the author over the program's CID, proving who sealed the link."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#AuthorSignature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "author signature"@en .
