<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#CanonicalForm> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#categoricalReading> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/concept/normal-form> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#CanonicalForm> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#CategoricalConcept> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#CategoricalConcept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A notion from category theory used to read how decks, parts and sections compose."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#CategoricalConcept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "categorical concept"@en .
