<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlLine> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A linear net that fires mute and unmute actions at section boundaries, which is how a song structure plays out."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Control net"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://ontology.pflow.xyz/ns#PetriNet> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#EngineNet> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://ontology.pflow.xyz/ns#PetriNet> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A control net is a linear workflow: its transitions fire once, in order."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#ControlNet> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNoun> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNoun> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The thing a control command acts on: a deck, a fader, an effect."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNoun> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "control noun"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNoun> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#DjConcept> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNoun> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#ControlNoun> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ControlNoun> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "stable" .
