<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#EngineConcept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A concept from the generator or sequencer that is not itself a genre property: the Bjorklund algorithm, Markov melody, swing and so on."@en .
