<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Form> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Form> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A shape for a whole track from classical music: its sections, the order they come in, and the plan of arrange mutations that changes them pass after pass. Each is a template built from public-domain themes (docs/forms)."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Form> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "form"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Form> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#MusicConcept> .
