<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#FormantVoice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#FormantVoice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A synthesised voice built from formants, the resonances that make vowels. It can sing a vocal line with no recorded voice involved."@en .
