<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Freeze> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Freeze> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A granular effect that holds one moment of a deck's sound and stretches it into a sustained texture."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Freeze> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "freeze"@en .
