<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Genre> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Genre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A style the sequencer can generate a whole track in. Each carries the defaults that make it recognisable: tempo, scale, drum rhythms, groove, feel."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Genre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Genre"@en .
