<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GenreFamily> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A group of genres that share song structures and section energy: edm, song, jazz, chill."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GenreFamily> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Genre family"@en .
