<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One production of BeatScript's grammar (grammar.ebnf, ISO 14977 EBNF; beatscript.app/docs/language). Its ns:ebnf is the right-hand side as written."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#GrammarProduction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "grammar production"@en .
