<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#PatternTransform> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#PatternTransform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A function from patterns to patterns, such as transpose or reverse. Transforms compose and have an identity, so they form a monoid."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#PatternTransform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pattern transform"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#PatternTransform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#EngineConcept> .
