<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProductFamily> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Product> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProductFamily> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A piece written in BeatScript: lines of text that compile to the Petri nets of a DJ deck. Identified by the CID of its canonical text, so a BeatScript 1 program and its upgrade to BeatScript 2, which play the same, are two programs: the upgrade is prov:wasRevisionOf the original, and each has its own ns:programCid and ns:inLanguageVersion."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BeatScript program"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#MusicConcept> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://ontology.pflow.xyz/ns#PetriNet> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hiddenLabel> "btw program"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote> "Before language version 2 (2026-11-22) the language was called btw, and a program was a btw program."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#Program> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Program> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramCID> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramCID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The content identifier of a program's canonical text."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramCID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "program CID"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramCID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ContentId> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramCID> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#ProgramCID> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramCID> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramLine> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramLine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One line of a BeatScript program. The kind of line says what it declares."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramLine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "program line"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramLine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#MusicConcept> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramLine> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#ProgramLine> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgramLine> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgrammingLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgrammingLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A text language whose documents are programs a product runs. Its versions (ns:LanguageVersion) are in the generated vocabulary, from the code that reads them."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgrammingLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "programming language"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgrammingLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Product> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ProgrammingLanguage> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Queue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Queue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The segments waiting to play next on a deck."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Queue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "queue"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#Queue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#DjConcept> .
