<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetList> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetList> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A plan for a DJ set: an ordered list of segments."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetList> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "set list"@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetList> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#DjConcept> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetList> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#SetList> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetList> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetRecording> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SetRecording> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A recording of a performed set, identified by a CID over its tracklist."@en .
