<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ShareLink> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ShareLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A URL that carries a whole track in itself: the program's CID and its deflated canonical text sit in the fragment, so opening the link needs no server lookup and the text can be checked against the CID. May include an author signature, and an unsealed notes segment that is not covered by the seal."@en .
