<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#ShareLink> <https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SongSection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SongSection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A named stretch of a song: intro, verse, drop and so on."@en .
<https://beatscript.app/ontology/ns#SongSection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Song section"@en .
